Package: ibmsmooth
Type: Package
Title: Integrated Brownian Motion Smoothing
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "Jessalyn", family = "Sebastian", email = "jessalys@uci.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits ordinary and horseshoe locally adaptive integrated Brownian
    motion smoothers for Gaussian observations using exact continuous-time
    state transitions in Stan. Ordinary smoothing accepts a user-supplied Stan
    prior for its positive smoothing parameter.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://jessalynnsebastian.github.io/ibmsmooth/,
    https://github.com/jessalynnsebastian/ibmsmooth
BugReports: https://github.com/jessalynnsebastian/ibmsmooth/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
